c; 8% at Phase 2 and funded on $200,000 Basic challenges bought since July 2026) / 6% static (Accelerated) / 6% trailing from highest balance (Turbo); funded static limits re-base on the balance left after each payout\",\"profitSplit\":\"80%; 90% with an upgrade bought with the challenge\",\"payoutCadence\":\"Every 14 calendar days with at least 5 profit days; per-cycle cap of 15%-50% of account size; USDT on TON, Base or BSC\",\"maxLeverage\":\"Basic and Accelerated: 100x forex, 15x US indices, 10x gold, silver, natural gas, copper, GER40, EU50 and KR200, 5x crypto, stocks and WTI; Turbo: 30x forex, 5x gold, silver and US indices, 3x natural gas, copper, GER40, EU50 and KR200, 2x crypto, stocks and WTI\",\"startingPriceUsd\":\"from $69 for a $5,000 crypto Basic account ($59 for the RWA version)\",\"minTradingDays\":\"3 profit days of 0.5%+ (Basic Stage 1, Accelerated); 5 (Basic Stage 2, each payout)\",\"consistencyRule\":\"No day at 30%+ of profit (Turbo, API accounts); none (Basic, Accelerated)\",\"usTraders\":\"No per its terms of use (its FAQ says it is available worldwide)\",\"feeRefund\":\"Only at the firm's discretion, per its terms of use\",\"newsTrading\":\"Allowed; US stocks go close-only 5 min around US macro releases\",\"weekendHolding\":\"Allowed; index positions opened or increased late Friday are closed in full\",\"entry\":{\"usd\":59,\"accountUsd\":5000},\"checkedAt\":\"2026-10-23\",\"programsCheckedAt\":\"2026-10-21\",\"page\":\"https://optimistfi.com/perps/props/upscale\",\"profile\":{\"country\":\"Seychelles\",\"entity\":\"Innovix Ltd.\",\"founded\":\"2025-03\",\"yearsInOperation\":1,\"platforms\":[\"Upscale web terminal\",\"Telegram Mini App\",\"Upscale API\"],\"maxAllocationUsd\":500000},\"assets\":[\"Crypto\",\"Stocks\",\"Indices\",\"Commodities\",\"Forex\"],\"offers\":[],\"lists\":[\"static-drawdown\",\"instant-funding\",\"no-daily-loss-limit\",\"stock-perps\",\"200k-accounts\"],\"trackedSince\":\"2026-09-23\",\"stockPerpCap\":{\"leverage\":5,