); reset at 20:00 New York time from balance plus reserved collateral, checked against equity\",\"maxDrawdownPct\":\"6% static from starting capital, on equity (1-step and 2-step); on Instant, static and equal to the price paid: 2% on $500, 4% on $5,000 to $50,000\",\"profitSplit\":\"80% or 90%, chosen at checkout (1-step; 90% costs more); 80% (2-step); 95% (Instant)\",\"payoutCadence\":\"On demand, 24/7, with no cap on how often or how much; each claim credits the split to the trader's Vest Primary Account within 24 hours, withdrawable in USDC to a wallet; open positions may need closing first\",\"maxLeverage\":\"25x on BTC, 15x on ETH, 10x on SOL; 75x on the S&P 500 (ES), 50x on the Nasdaq 100, Russell 2000 and Dow; 25x on NVDA and gold (GC); 10x on WTI crude, TSLA, MU, INTC, SNDK and SPCX; 5x on all other stocks, ETFs, FX, silver, platinum, copper, Brent and natural gas; XRP and HYPE not tradeable funded (per its leverage table; the same page's text puts BTC at 15x)\",\"startingPriceUsd\":\"from $15 for a $5,000 account (2-Step); 1-Step from $25 with a 20% target; Instant Accounts from $10 for $500\",\"minTradingDays\":\"None\",\"consistencyRule\":\"None\",\"usTraders\":\"Yes (prop terms allow it; profit goes to a Vest exchange account, whose terms bar the US)\",\"feeRefund\":\"Only if unused: within 3 days of purchase, before any trade\",\"newsTrading\":\"Allowed\",\"weekendHolding\":\"Allowed; non-crypto markets lock from Friday evening to Sunday evening New York time\",\"entry\":{\"usd\":15,\"accountUsd\":5000},\"checkedAt\":\"2026-10-26\",\"programsCheckedAt\":\"2026-10-26\",\"page\":\"https://optimistfi.com/perps/props/vest-markets\",\"profile\":{\"country\":\"Panama\",\"entity\":\"Vest Exchange Inc.\",\"platforms\":[\"Vest Markets web terminal\"],\"maxAllocationUsd\":250000},\"assets\":[\"Crypto\",\"Stocks\",\"ETFs\",\"Indices\",\"Commodities\",\"Forex\"],\"offers\":[],\"lists\":[\"static-drawdown\",\"under-50\",\"instant-funding\",\"no-daily-loss-limit\",\